P6,n/a,178624000,234289152,2026-11-06,54958224,,9071456,34893008,38938424,2026-11-05,2026-09-02,"windows_gtk4 n/a by design: P6 IS the D3D11 video test. It uses D3D11VideoSurface in 8 places and WinUIElementRepresentable in 2, one of them before the D3D11 types are declared, so the WinUIBackend dependency cannot be split off. A -gtk4 P6 would open a window and be unable to test the one thing it exists for"
P6-v2,56804864,n/a,,,54783240,,,,,,2026-09-02,"windows_winui n/a by design: P6-v2 imports Gtk and GtkBackend unconditionally at lines 3-4, with no conditional compilation. It is a pure GTK app and has no WinUI counterpart to build"
